# Common Deployment Patterns
Astronomer supports **three primary deployment patterns**, giving organizations the flexibility to choose the right model for their security posture, infrastructure maturity, and operational preferences.

1. Hosted
    Everything managed by Astro.
    Astro handles orchestration + execution
    Simplest model.

    Good for:
        normal companies
        non-sensitive data

2. Hybrid
    Astro handles scheduling.
    Your environment handles execution.
    Most recommended for enterprises.

3. Fully Remote
    Everything runs inside your environment.
    Maximum security/control.
    Astronomer provides only control plane.

