#                       Final End-to-End Flow

Here’s the complete workflow:

Step 1
    Scheduler in Astro decides:
    Run DAG task

Step 2
    Remote Agent contacts Astro.
    "Any tasks for me?"

Step 3
    Astro sends task metadata.
    NOT actual sensitive data.

Step 4
    Worker executes task locally.
    Inside:
        Kubernetes
        On-prem environment

Step 5
    Agent sends:
        logs
        status
        heartbeat
    back to Astro.

